  <div class="row mt-5">
    <div class="col">
      <h1>Welcome To Horizon Aid's Design System</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col pt-3">
      <span class="h5">Consistent, Compassionate Digital Experiences — Wherever We Work</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Horizon Aid delivers education, healthcare, emergency medicine, agriculture, and support for women in crisis and under-served regions around the world — from Somalia to Ukraine to Guatemala. This design system is what keeps every appeal, program page, and country profile looking and feeling like Horizon Aid, no matter who builds it or how fast it needs to go live. Built on reusable Single Directory Components, it lets our team assemble trustworthy, accessible pages in minutes instead of days.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>How to Use It</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Every component here — the interactive world map, program tabs, impact stat figures, donation-ready cards — is ready to drop straight into a page. Browse the Foundation section for our brand colors, type, and icons, explore the Figma file for the full visual system, and start assembling the next appeal or country page with pieces that already look like Horizon Aid.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 bg-light p-5 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center w-25">
        <img class="d-flex mx-auto d-block" src="/components/foundation/images/assets/figma-logo.svg" width="50px" alt="Figma icon logo" />
        <a class="d-flex justify-content-center"href="https://www.figma.com/design/shEqHupsCBTp2CmIiA84rv/VB---Stylesheet_2024">View Figma File</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>What’s Included?</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <h3 class="mt-4">01 - Brand Foundation</h3>
      <p>Horizon Aid's colors, typography, icons, and logos — the building blocks behind every appeal and program page.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">02 - Program &amp; Impact Components</h3>
      <p>The interactive country map, program tabs, impact stat figures, and country sliders that tell Horizon Aid's story.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">03 - Page Components</h3>
      <p>Hero banners, media banners, and card layouts ready to launch a new appeal or country profile.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

